    "refined_text": "Perform a dual-bank firmware upgrade on the Nordic nRF52840 system-on-chip using MCUboot and the nRF Connect SDK. Follow these operational procedures to stage, verify, and permanently validate the image swap in flash:\n\n1. Build the signed application update binary using `west build -b nrf52840dk_nrf52840 -- -DCONFIG_MCUBOOT_IMAGE_VERSION=\"2.1.0\"` with cryptographic signature verification enabled.\n2. Write the update binary to the secondary flash slot at address `0x00080000` using `nrfjprog --program update.bin` with automated sector erase operations over high-speed SWD.\n3. Mark the secondary image slot for test reboot by writing the pending swap flag into the flash scratch partition.\n4. Power cycle the board and confirm successful image swap validation by checking serial console logs for confirmation messages and new version strings upon startup without errors or triggering automatic firmware rollback procedures."
