    "refined_text": "Execute these structured migration steps to transition an existing iOS project from CocoaPods dependency management to Swift Package Manager.\n1. Remove CocoaPods integration artifacts by executing `pod deintegrate` in your project root and deleting `Podfile`, `Podfile.lock`, and the generated `.xcworkspace` bundle.\n2. Open `App.xcodeproj` directly in Xcode and navigate to `Project > Package Dependencies` to add remote Git repositories for each required third-party dependency.\n3. Update module import statements in Swift source files to reference SPM package products and execute `xcodebuild -scheme App -destination \"generic/platform=iOS\" build` to verify clean automated compilation."
