    "raw_asr": "reduce dynamic power consumpti in f p g a buy inserting bufgce clock gating primitives on idle processing blocks disable cloak tree when processing valid signal is deasserted to save switching power without causing cloak glitches on flip flop cloak inputs or introducing phase jitter",
