    "refined_text": "Close static timing on high-speed 10GbE optical transceiver channels in Intel Quartus Prime Pro using structured fitter passes:\n1. Define source-synchronous clock and data constraints in the SDC file using `derive_pll_clocks` alongside `set_input_delay` max and min parameters for external interface pins.\n2. Execute `quartus_fit` with seed exploration enabled across five distinct placement seeds to discover optimal transceiver routing channels and reduce localized routing congestion.\n3. Verify final timing closure by running Quartus Timing Analyzer with `quartus_sta` and examining worst negative slack across high-speed serial transceiver clocks to ensure zero setup and hold violations."
