    "raw_asr": "to bring up production u v m verification environment four a x i four lite peripheral registers follow these architectural steps first build a register model extending u v m reg block containing accurate address offsets and register access policies four all internal control and status registers second integrate a x i four lite master agent containing driver sequencer and monitor components mapped through a custom u v m reg adapter to convert generic transactions third create virtual sequence executing read after write sanity checks across all memory mapped configuration registers and verify transaction data integrity inside the u v m scoreboard confirming protocol compliance and reporting zero errors",
