    "refined_text": "Interface a PCIe Gen3 hard IP endpoint core with a high-bandwidth packet processing datapath using AXI-Stream bridges:\n1. Configure the integrated PCIe endpoint block for eight-lane operation at eight gigatransfers per second within the IP core parameterizer graphical interface.\n2. Connect the PCIe requester and completer streams to a multi-channel scatter-gather DMA engine using standard AXI4-Stream framing signals and flow control credits.\n3. Implement circular ring descriptor buffers in host shared memory to manage packet queues efficiently with minimal interrupt and transfer overhead, sustaining full PCIe Gen3 line-rate throughput during continuous bi-directional DMA streaming operations."
