    "raw_asr": "to automate regression test execution four fpga digital designs using model sim and command line automation scripts follow this verification workflow first construct modular makefile that compiles shared v h d l packages using v com dash twenty zero eight and systemverilog verification code using v log dash s v in strict topological dependency order second execute batch simulation runs with v sim dash c dash do run dash all semicolon quit dash l simulation dot log to execute testbenches without opening graphical user interface third parse output simulation transcripts using automated verification scripts to verify zero assertion failures and zero u v m error reports generating consolidated pass and fail regression summary logs and coverage metric summaries",
    "refined_text": "Automate regression test execution for FPGA digital designs using ModelSim and command-line automation scripts:\n1. Construct a modular Makefile that compiles shared VHDL packages using `vcom -2008` and SystemVerilog verification code using `vlog -sv` in strict topological dependency order.\n2. Execute batch simulation runs with `vsim -c -do \"run -all; quit\" -l simulation.log` to execute testbenches without opening the graphical user interface.\n3. Parse output simulation transcripts using automated verification scripts to verify zero assertion failures and zero UVM error reports, generating consolidated pass and fail regression summary logs and coverage metric summaries."
