    "refined_text": "Achieve timing closure on highly congested FPGA designs approaching 90 percent resource utilization through structured physical floorplanning:\n1. Examine post-route routing congestion heatmaps and critical timing paths using the Vivado timing analysis engine to isolate routing bottlenecks and congestion hotspots.\n2. Define modular floorplanning Pblocks by grouping critical arithmetic logic into localized clock regions using `create_pblock` and `resize_pblock` commands to bound wire lengths.\n3. Execute incremental placement and routing with directive `-directive Explore` to achieve timing sign-off with zero setup and hold violations, locking down routed pins across verified hierarchical boundaries."
