    "refined_text": "Building an autonomous health check monitor for edge computer vision microservices ensures rapid recovery from camera disconnects or model crash loops in unattended edge deployments.\n1. Inspect video device node availability at `/dev/video0` every five seconds using `v4l2-ctl --list-devices`.\n2. Verify incoming frame freshness by checking timestamp differences in the shared ring buffer.\n3. If frame acquisition stalls for more than three seconds, issue a soft restart to the capture thread and reset hardware USB bus using `usbreset`.\n4. If the inference worker crashes due to CUDA out-of-memory exceptions, restart the containerized service using `docker compose restart vision_worker` and notify telemetry services of the failover event."
