    "refined_text": "Investigate and resolve asynchronous MPI communication deadlocks encountered during large-scale atmospheric simulation execution on distributed cluster architectures across multiple compute racks.\n\n1. Attach the GDB debugger across distributed ranks using `mpirun -np 1024 -x UCX_ERROR_SIGNALS=SIGSEGV,SIGBUS,SIGABRT xterm -e gdb ./sim` to isolate stalled worker threads.\n2. Inspect parallel stack traces across compute domains to identify unbalanced collective barriers where mismatched rank counts trigger indefinite blocking waits inside `MPI_Waitall` loops across computing boundaries.\n3. Replace unsynchronized point-to-point exchanges with robust non-blocking non-deadlocking primitives using `MPI_Irecv` and `MPI_Isend` coupled with explicit request handle tracking to ensure deterministic message completion throughout the cluster environment."
