    "refined_text": "Diagnose multi-node NCCL collective communication bottlenecks and detect bandwidth throttling across InfiniBand leaf-spine switch fabrics during distributed training runs on accelerated clusters.\n\n1. Enable detailed communication tracing by defining environment variables `NCCL_DEBUG=INFO`, `NCCL_DEBUG_SUBSYS=INIT,ENV,COLL`, and `NCCL_TOPO_DUMP_FILE=/tmp/nccl_topo.xml` across all participating worker nodes in the cluster.\n2. Run the NCCL collective performance benchmark across 16 GPU nodes using `srun --nodes=16 --ntasks-per-node=8 ./nccl-tests/build/all_reduce_perf -b 1G -e 16G -f 2` to measure ring and tree throughput.\n3. Correlate detected throughput drops with switch port counters by running `ibqueryerrors -c` and verifying uniform packet distribution across adaptive routing groups to identify congested links and optical fabric errors."
