    "refined_text": "Deploy containerized high-performance computing applications using Apptainer with native InfiniBand fabric and GPU hardware passthrough across distributed cluster nodes in production environments.\n\n1. Build the reproducible execution container definition containing OpenMPI and CUDA runtime drivers using `apptainer build hpc_app.sif apptainer.def` across dedicated build servers to ensure reproducible scientific execution across nodes.\n2. Configure Slurm batch submission parameters requesting dedicated compute resources and GPU accelerators via `#SBATCH --nodes=4 --ntasks-per-node=4 --gres=gpu:4` in the job script.\n3. Execute the containerized MPI binary by running `srun apptainer exec --nv --bind /scratch:/scratch hpc_app.sif /opt/app/bin/solver -i /scratch/input.json` to achieve bare-metal execution performance and isolate application dependencies completely."
