    "refined_text": "Diagnose physical layer bit error rate anomalies on InfiniBand fabric links and verify signal restoration following transceiver replacement across high-performance leaf switch ports in the datacenter.\n\n1. Identify failing physical links by collecting low-level counter telemetry using `ibqueryerrors -c -r -s PortRcvErrors,LinkErrorRecoveryCounter,SymbolErrorCounter` across all switch ports.\n2. Clear accumulated hardware error registers on target switch ports by invoking `perfquery -R -G -a` across the affected fabric subnet before initiating cable testing.\n3. Reseat optical cables, re-evaluate link health via `ibportstate 42 1 reset`, and inspect link speed confirmation using `ibstat` to ensure full HDR bandwidth and stable signaling without dropped packets."
