    "refined_text": "Implement automated enterprise filesystem backups for IBM Spectrum Scale clusters using `mmbackup` and an external tape storage subsystem for long-term disaster recovery and compliance archiving.\n\n1. Initialize the backup configuration and audit shadow database tables by executing `mmbackup gpfs1 -t incremental -S /var/mmbackup/shadow_db` across all cluster nodes in the storage domain.\n2. Apply file exclusion filters by specifying `-s /etc/gpfs/backup_exclude.lst` to skip temporary scratch files and active checkpoint lock files during directory scanning.\n3. Schedule recurring backup execution via cron script and examine backup completion status by parsing `/var/log/mmbackup.log` for unbacked files to ensure complete disaster recovery readiness across storage pools."
