    "refined_text": "Deploy a multi-node distributed training pipeline for large language models using DeepSpeed, Slurm sbatch, and NCCL across accelerated supercomputing clusters with high-bandwidth fabrics.\n\n1. Generate the hostfile dynamically in the Slurm submission script by running `scontrol show hostnames $SLURM_JOB_NODELIST > /tmp/hostfile` across nodes to discover assigned compute hosts.\n2. Configure distributed environment flags by exporting `MASTER_ADDR=$(scontrol show hostnames $SLURM_JOB_NODELIST | head -n 1)` and `MASTER_PORT=29500` for master rank communication and establish reliable inter-node synchronization channels.\n3. Launch DeepSpeed across all allocated compute nodes by executing `deepspeed --hostfile /tmp/hostfile --num_gpus 8 pretrain.py --deepspeed_config ds_config.json` to begin scalable parallel optimization without node stalls."
