    "refined_text": "To recover unallocated space and repair damaged block allocation tables after an unexpected operating system failure in WiredTiger, execute this maintenance sequence systematically across storage files.\n\n1. Inspect the block manager allocation state in the database log to identify unreferenced physical extents left dangling by interrupted checkpoint flushes across files.\n2. Open the database using `wiredtiger_open()` with the `repair=true` and `logging=false` configuration parameters to initiate internal block manager scans across all data files.\n3. Reconstruct the physical block extent freetree by verifying file headers and scanning page allocation bitmaps to safely return orphan disk sectors to the allocation pool without data loss."
