    "refined_text": "To reclaim physical storage space and eliminate index fragmentation following massive record deletions in a B+ tree storage engine, follow this reorganization sequence cleanly across storage volumes.\n\n1. Execute a sequential scan across leaf page headers to compute fill factors and detect underflowed pages whose cell occupancy has fallen below 40% capacity.\n2. Coalesce adjacent underflowed sibling pages by copying valid cell payloads into a single destination leaf and returning empty pages to the storage allocator pool.\n3. Update parent interior node separator keys to reflect merged key boundaries, pruning obsolete child pointers and rebalancing parent index blocks recursively throughout the tree."
