    "refined_text": "Systematic base quality score errors skew variant caller confidence estimates. Apply empirical base recalibrations using `gatk ApplyBQSR -R ref.fa -I raw.bam --bqsr-recal-file recal.table -O recal.bam` to replace raw Phred qualities with recalibrated scores."
